1
00:00:00,446 --> 00:00:02,772
In the Himalayas, walking is not enough.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:06,360
Optimus Prime trained G1 for four failure modes:

3
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:09,432
falls, lost footing, cliff descent, and blocked

4
00:00:09,467 --> 00:00:10,063
routes.

5
00:00:10,246 --> 00:00:11,702
First: self-arrest.

6
00:00:11,988 --> 00:00:14,078
During oblique falls up to five meters per

7
00:00:14,113 --> 00:00:17,026
second, G1 plants the axe, loads the pick,

8
00:00:17,061 --> 00:00:18,842
